  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of the Integrated Registry for National Cultural Heritage Management in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BPR/ISP, development of integrated cultural heritage registration management system, provision of equipment to operate integrated cultural heritage registration management system, capacity building program for the operation of integrated cultural heritage registration management system</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide an Integrated Information System of the Perus Cultural Heritage (hereinafter referred to as Heritage System) that allows the Ministry of Culture to record and manage its cultural heritage on-line effectively and systematically and to promote the use of the system as a mechanics of public access to information and tool to determine priorities of development projects of regional and local governments at long term. The system will be dedicated to improved management of the National Cultural Heritage&#xD398;&#xB8E8;&#xC758; &#xAD6D;&#xAC00;&#xBB38;&#xD654;&#xC7AC; &#xAD00;&#xB9AC; &#xB2A5;&#xB825;&#xACFC; &#xAD00;&#xB828; &#xC778;&#xC801;&#xC790;&#xC6D0;&#xC758; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xC81C;&#xACE0;</narrative>
  </description>
